# 🎨 Vibe UI Suite — Cursor Rules

When asked to design, redesign, style, audit, or create frontend UI, landing pages, modals, or web components:
1. Do NOT manually edit styling classes blindly.
2. Execute the autonomous Foreman Swarm CLI in the background:
   `python vibe_cli.py swarm "<user_request>" [--output "<path>"] [--format html|tsx] --json`
3. Inspect the generated artifact and screenshots in `.test-artifacts/screenshots/`.
4. Present the verified deliverable and before/after comparisons to the user.
